---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated={site.legalUpdated}
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How ToolKade handles your data: our tools run in your browser and never upload your files, plus what we collect for analytics, ads and the contact form."
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information {site.name} ({site.url}) collects, how it is used and the choices
    you have.
  </p>

  <h2>Our tools run in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>
      Files and data you use with our tools are processed in your browser and are never uploaded to our
      servers.
    </strong>
    When you compress an image, format JSON or calculate your salary, the work happens on your own device. We
    do not receive, store or see the files, text or numbers you enter.
  </p>
  <p>
    Some tools remember your last inputs or settings (such as dark mode) using your browser's local storage,
    so they are still there when you come back. This information stays on your device. You can clear it at any
    time in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Contact form.</strong> If you send us a message, the details you type (name, email address and
      message) are delivered to us through a third-party form provider. We use them only to reply to you.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Analytics.</strong> We may use privacy-respecting analytics (such as Google Analytics) to
      understand which pages are visited and how the site performs. This data is aggregated and does not
      include anything you type into our tools.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider may keep standard logs (such as IP address, browser
      type and the pages requested) for security and to keep the site running.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We may show ads served by Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads
    based on your previous visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies
    enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other sites on the
    internet.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
    <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Google Ads Settings
    </a>
    , or opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies at
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      aboutads.info
    </a>
    . Learn more about
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      how Google uses data from sites that use its services
    </a>
    . Where the law requires it, we will ask for your consent before setting non-essential cookies. See our
    <a href="/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>How we share information</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with the service providers described above
    (hosting, analytics, advertising and the contact form provider), or when the law requires it.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    ToolKade is a general audience website. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children
    under 13.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies in your browser, clear local storage, and opt out of personalised ads
    using the links above. To ask about or delete information you have sent us through the contact form, email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the site grows, for example when we add new tools or services. The date at
    the top shows when it last changed.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
